Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_DESCRIPTION (.*)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface name:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}
  ^Chassis ID:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^Port ID:\s+${PORT_ID}
  ^Port Description:\s+${PORT_DESCRIPTION}
  ^System Name:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME} -> Record
